In the bathroom, it is still a little cold.
But the water is nicely warm.
I stand in front of the mirror and wash myself.
Then I brush my teeth.
After that, I go into my bedroom.
I open my wardrobe.
What do I put on today?
February in Berlin is very cold.
I take blue jeans.
First, I put on the jeans.
I also need a thick sweater.
I take a large sweater made of wool.
Then I put on the sweater.
It is very soft and warm.
Now I am no longer cold.
I quickly brush my hair as well.
Now I am ready for the day.
